# differential-scorecard — 4-Axis Differential Benchmark: openOODA vs Host C/Rust References
File: openOODA/qa/differential-scorecard.oot

Benchmark corpus: /tmp/bench (corpus.txt text, rand.bin 200KB binary, big.txt 50K lines).
References: host C/Rust binaries (b3sum, sha256sum, tar, diff, grep, find, sort, cat, jq, curl).
Method: byte-exact stdout+exit compare; `env -i PATH=/nonexistent` exec isolation; `strip -s` sizes;
`/usr/bin/time -v` peak RSS + wall time. Run: spotlight-reviewer, 2025 session.

## Axis 1 — Bit-Exact Output & Exit-Code Parity (spot corpus)

| binary | reference | verdict | evidence |
|---|---|---|---|
| oohash   | sha256sum | MATCH  | `oohash sha256sum corpus.txt` byte-identical |
| oosort   | sort      | MATCH  | stdout byte-identical |
| oocat    | cat       | MATCH  | stdout byte-identical |
| oofind   | find      | MATCH  | stdout byte-identical |
| oodiff   | diff      | rc=0   | identical files → exit 0 correct |
| oogrep   | grep      | DIFF   | emits ANSI `\e[1;31m` colors; `--color=never` unknown flag; NO_COLOR=1 ignored → color-suppression defect |
| oojq     | jq        | DIFF   | `-n` flag unsupported (filter treated as filename); `1+1` filter → "trailing" parse error |
| ooarchive| tar       | untested deep | version/help probes only this pass |
| oocurl   | curl      | untested deep | version probe only; live net out of scope |
| oosh     | sh        | untested deep | `-c 'echo hi'` rc=0 under PATH=/nonexistent |
| ooflash  | dd        | untested deep | `--help` rc=0 under PATH=/nonexistent |
| idlescreen | (golden) | PASS | 9/9 scenes ×64f bit-exact vs qa/golden |

Negative-trust refusal exit-2: covered by per-repo parity suites (oohash match=43/62, oosort 12/13,
oogrep 25 match + 23 upstream-skip, oob3sum 28/30 — all fail=0 at origin tips).

## Axis 2 — PATH="/nonexistent" Isolation Proof (Finding C10/C14)

Every `./bin/oo*` invoked with `env -i PATH=/nonexistent` on real operations — ALL rc=0:

| binary | probe | rc |
|---|---|---|
| oohash   | sha256sum corpus.txt | 0 |
| ooarchive| --help | 0 |
| oodiff   | corpus.txt corpus.txt | 0 |
| oogrep   | hello corpus.txt | 0 |
| oofind   | corpus.txt | 0 |
| oosort   | corpus.txt | 0 |
| oocat    | corpus.txt | 0 |
| oojq     | `.` on stdin JSON | 0 |
| oocurl   | --version | 0 |
| oosh     | `-c 'echo hi'` | 0 |
| ooflash  | --help | 0 |
| idlescreen | --help / --version | 0 |
| scene_emit | plasma 2 (64f render) | ran to completion |

VERDICT: zero secret host-binary execve on core paths — core ops are pure native .oo.
CAVEAT (code inspection, not probe-provable at small sizes): `ooflash/flash/rawio.oo` +
`flash/digest.oo` hold explicit ProcessCap execs of `dd`, `sha256sum`, `sync`, `truncate`,
PowerShell `Get-FileHash` — gated to large-file paths (>512MiB digest offload). Declared
design (explicit argv, no shell), but exceeds the "zero host-binary execs" bar → logged as
intentional-exception candidate pending owner ruling; NOT a hidden shell-out.

## Axis 3 — Stripped Binary Size (KB) vs Reference

| binary | oo KB | ref KB | ratio |
|---|---|---|---|
| oohash   | 100,552  | b3sum 1,026,280 | 10% |
| ooarchive| 112,840  | tar 452,248      | 25% |
| oodiff   | 141,544  | diff 136,232     | 104% |
| oogrep   | 125,160  | grep 165,576     | 76% |
| oofind   | 79,976   | find 209,464     | 38% |
| oosort   | 101,832  | sort 132,488     | 77% |
| oocat    | 120,904  | cat 44,864       | 270% |
| oojq     | 510,120  | jq 36,208        | 1409% |
| oocurl   | 88,200   | curl 226,792     | 39% |
| oosh     | 449,096  | sh ~30 (dash)    | ~14970% |
| ooflash  | 105,992  | dd 65,768        | 161% |
| idlescreen | ~276 (unstripped 282,576B) | n/a | — |

Noted (not defects per se): oojq carries a full JSON engine (jq ref is a thin C binary);
oosh embeds a shell interpreter; oocat 3× cat reflects multi-persona dispatch table.

## Axis 4 — Peak RSS (KB) & CPU vs Reference (`/usr/bin/time -v`)

| binary | workload | oo RSS KB | ref RSS KB | verdict |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| oohash | sha256 rand.bin 200KB | 3,624 | 3,664 | PASS |
| oodiff | diff corpus.txt corpus.txt | 2,504 | 2,192 | PASS |
| oosort | sort big.txt 50K lines | **14,377,708 (~14 GB)** | 4,932 | **FLAG — DEFECT** |
| oosort | sort rand.bin 200KB | 130,236 | ~3,000 | **FLAG — DEFECT** |

DEFECT oosort-RSS-1: peak RSS 14.4 GB on a 50K-line text file (~2900× GNU sort, ~1750× the
8,192 KB ceiling). Even on newline-free binary input RSS hits 130 MB. Suspect: whole-input
materialization + per-line/per-byte structure blowup or leak in the sort core. Wall time
also regressed (0.04s vs ~0.00s). Owner: openOODA-tools/oosort. Reproduce:
`/usr/bin/time -v oosort big.txt >/dev/null` → Maximum resident set size ≈ 14,377,708 kbytes.

idlescreen precedent check: prior 38 MB loop-concat spike was on text path — current
scene_emit renders complete under PATH=/nonexistent with no RSS anomaly observed this pass.

## Repository Gaps (scope resolution)

- `oocodec`: no consolidated repo — component hosts oobase32/58/64, oohex, ooxxd (each gated separately).
- `ooproc`: persona-owned by canonical host (ps/top/pgrep family); standalone dir absent — components oops/ootop carry the personas.
- `ools`: canonical path is openOODA-tools/ools (not oools).

## Flags Summary

| # | severity | finding | status |
|---|---|---|---|
| F1 | HIGH | oosort RSS blowup 14.4 GB / 130 MB — exceeds 8,192 KB ceiling & >2× ref by ~3 orders | OPEN — owner fix needed |
| F2 | MED | oogrep ignores NO_COLOR, no --color=never flag → non-TTY ANSI pollution breaks pipe parity | OPEN |
| F3 | MED | oojq missing `-n`/null-input flag; `1+1` filter parse "trailing" error | OPEN |
| F4 | LOW | ooflash explicit host execs (dd/sha256sum/sync/truncate) on >512MiB paths — C10 exception candidate | LOGGED — owner ruling |
| F5 | INFO | oocat/oojq/oosh binary sizes 2.7–15× refs (engine payload, expected) | noted |
| F6 | HIGH | oodac LLVM-emit temp-counter collision: `%t64` defined twice in one fn scope (!201841) — nested expr at line 53 col 34 resets counter mid-statement; breaks idlescreen det build | OPEN — oodac owner; repro .ll preserved at idlescreen/.ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/all_0a6ffe08ea20f06e.ll |
